                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Note</hi>.—The total of the census of 1871 should be
                    32,903 instead of 32,862. The difference is explained by the fact that 41 slaves
                    are either in prison or in the almshouse. These were not included in the census,
                    their names not appearing in the register, but only as emancipated.</p>
